<subsection xml:id="gradepercent"><title>Grading System</title>

<p>Grades will be determined as follows:

<tabular>
    <row>
        <cell>Homework</cell>
        <cell >25%</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
        <cell>Activities and Check Your Understanding</cell>
        <cell >25%</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
        <cell>Group Oral Assessments of Learning</cell>
        <cell >40%</cell>
    </row>

    <row>
        <cell>Daily Questions</cell>
        <cell >10%</cell>
    </row>


</tabular></p>

<p>Letter grades correspond to the following percentages:</p>

<tabular>
  <row>
              <cell>A-, A</cell>
              <cell >90-100%</cell>
            </row>

            <row>
              <cell>B-, B, B+</cell>
              <cell >80-89%</cell>
            </row>

            <row>
              <cell>C-, C, C+</cell>
              <cell >65-79%</cell>
            </row>

            <row>
              <cell>D</cell>
              <cell >55-64%</cell>
            </row>

          
</tabular>

</subsection>
</section>